00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,686
We're back in the real world!

261
00:14:37,860 --> 00:14:38,690
Mokuba!

262
00:14:39,420 --> 00:14:41,140
He's still back there!

263
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,960
Thank you for helping me, Mokuba.

264
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,200
I'm glad I got to know my brother.

265
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,911
So, does this mean you're not coming back?

266
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,140
I am.

267
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:54,900
But I must return to cyberspace first.

268
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,497
But it's shutting down, Noah!

269
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,240
I'll be back.

270
00:15:02,820 --> 00:15:04,237
Then come with me now!

271
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,700
I'm afraid there's something
I still have to do, Mokuba.

272
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:11,520
You believed in me and you
treated me like a brother.

273
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:16,060
Now it's my turn to return the favor.

274
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:17,410
Noah!

275
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,500
Don't go!

276
00:15:19,660 --> 00:15:20,490
Noah!

277
00:15:21,620 --> 00:15:24,460
Mokuba, wake up! Mokuba!

278
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:27,420
Open your eyes!

279
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:31,530
Mokuba...

280
00:15:31,613 --> 00:15:33,440
Seto, Noah's still inside!

281
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:38,100
I'll mistake even without a body.

282
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:41,640
I can upload my mind to another network.

283
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,960
Not a chance.

284
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:45,370
You.

285
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:49,817
I've sealed off all the exits,
so there's no way you can escape.

286
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:53,140
I'm afraid it's all over for you. Alert.

287
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:54,850
Alert.

288
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:57,354
Central computer network will destruct.

289
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,385
Evacuate the base immediately.

290
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,897
Why did Noah have to go
back to that place, guys?

291
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:04,940
Guys, it's not fair!

292
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:07,380
Where are those guys?

293
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:13,280
We have to go before that computer
blows, and time is running out!

294
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:14,720
I'm on already.

295
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,820
Warning, missile approaching.

296
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,960
I cannot be stopped!

297
00:16:19,420 --> 00:16:23,100
What makes you think you have
the power to keep me here?

298
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:29,180
I can control this place as well.

299
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:30,650
No!

300
00:16:30,733 --> 00:16:32,320
You choose them over me?

301
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:35,040
At least they believed in me.

302
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:38,820
We're family, and don't ever forget that.

303
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:42,280
I'm sorry, but I can't let you hurt them.

304
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:44,740
So I'm keeping you trapped in here.

305
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,260
Sound familiar?

306
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,200
Who are you doing?

307
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:52,140
I command you to release
me immediately, Noah.

308
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:58,180
I'm going to free your mind and make
sure you never harm anyone again.

309
00:16:58,760 --> 00:16:59,590
Oh, no!

310
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:05,240
Khybercraft 3, preparing for
takeoff. Hold on. Here they come.

311
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:06,800
Hurry up, guys.

312
00:17:07,140 --> 00:17:08,020
Let's go.

313
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:09,360
You can make it.

314
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,100
Engaging rear thruster.

315
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,220
Pick up the pace, you guys.

316
00:17:14,420 --> 00:17:15,517
You're almost here.

317
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:19,000
We got you. Let's go. Grab on. Hurry.

318
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,711
I'm not going to make it.

319
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,460
Guess again.

320
00:17:25,860 --> 00:17:26,690
Catch.

321
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,260
Yugi! Joey!

322
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:33,910
He's in!

323
00:17:33,993 --> 00:17:35,469
Now let's get out of here!

324
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:40,390
Warning.

325
00:17:40,473 --> 00:17:41,420
Virtual meltdown.

326
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:43,120
No! Let me go!

327
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:44,660
You can't keep me here!

328
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,630
Mr.

329
00:18:02,713 --> 00:18:06,425
Kaiba, I'm afraid this ship is
too slow to escape the explosion.

330
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:08,180
I'm taking control.

331
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:13,650
Sato!

332
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:16,180
You'll never escape me!

333
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:22,540
Sorry, old man, but there's
no way I'll let you win.

334
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:46,180
Noah may have been a spoiled
brat when we met him,

335
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:48,017
but he turned out to be all right.

336
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:51,737
Do you think his mind was deleted
when the computer was destroyed?

337
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:54,700
Knowing him, he saved his
mind on a backup file.

338
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,200
Yeah, I bet he'll be back. Me too.

339
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:59,660
See you around, Noah.

340
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:01,380
All right.

341
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:05,197
That little detour was a complete
waste of my time and effort.

342
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:08,692
So let's move on and pretend
that nonsense never happened.

343
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:12,560
It's time for us to continue
the Battle City Finals.

344
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:17,400
Set us back on course to
Kaivakorp Island. Yes, sir.
